<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on single Swiss stocks.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on single Swiss stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank has issued American-style</p>
<p>call warrants on three single Swiss stocks.</p>
<p>The stocks are Winterthur Insurance Co, Swiss</p>
<p>Reinsurance Co and Zurich Insurance Centre.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   11.NOV.98	     PAYDATE	 20.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		   MIN EXER LOT  100</p>
<p>* * * * WARRANTS     STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM</p>
<p> WINTERTHUR   1,200 CHF  2.05 CHF  14.3 PCT</p>
<p> SWISS RE     1,850 CHF  3.66 CHF  12.6 PCT</p>
<p> ZURICH INS     525 CHF  2.25 CHF  15.4 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
